# Applies to BOTH Vercel projects that deploy from this single repo:
#   - the API project       (Root Directory = repo root, app.py)
#   - the dashboard project (Root Directory = dashboard)
#
# IMPORTANT: do NOT add "dashboard/" here. This file is applied to the dashboard
# project's build too, and excluding the directory empties that build — it was
# observed failing the dashboard deployment until the entry was removed.
data/
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-shm
*.sqlite-wal
.env
.env.*
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
